{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（22日）中午12時46分，警方接報旺角彌敦道664號惠豐中心的citibank職員報案，指兩名男女持24張面額100美金，懷疑是假鈔。人員到場經初步調查，以行使懷疑偽製紙幣拘捕兩名男女。</p><figure><img alt=\"一男一女被捕帶署。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145721793005228032981463.jpeg/Ffk8LUqxY9x5ntX7M9HcvYmCeGH6oqLJa55JzWueSc0\"/><figcaption>一男一女被捕帶署。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一男一女被捕帶署。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145722616275800064613572.jpeg/YULFoHCBTGUfMyvVYFqNvloWLmMoIvrM0OC2JNDgtiQ\"/><figcaption>一男一女被捕帶署。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><p>警方調查後稱，被捕男子姓李62歲、印尼籍女子22歲，持本港身份證。</p><p>警方接獲職員報案，指二人在銀行使用24張懷疑偽鈔作繳款。人員接報到場，2人涉嫌「行使偽製紙幣」被捕，案件交由旺角警區刑事調查隊第五隊跟進。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場是惠豐中心citibank。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145723121735569408056817.jpeg/aUHs95Xk122WyBq-Gp_XIE7OLY5QPkIl_uNB4_7jQeM\"/><figcaption>現場是惠豐中心citibank。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是惠豐中心citibank。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145723124856262656762941.jpeg/4kCbEN5dfcl2ofBZ7KKS_QQTe-zaA12PbxheBm8YXgY\"/><figcaption>現場是惠豐中心citibank。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一男一女被帶走。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145723127901458432540638.jpeg/XeQU144Geiy-rWCFDZMru-xN_FUeSfTFDP33ZQz992U\"/><figcaption>一男一女被帶走。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-22T06:59:01.391584+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":293,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}